content.text:
The evidence points to one fault. The UI's preserve calls are failing because the preserve service's calls to security return corrupted response bodies. I'm not naming security as a fault because its own server spans are normal and hubble shows no drops or retransmits on the link. Restarts are unchanged from normal, so there is no pod churn.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "ts-preserve-service",
      "fault_kind": "http_response_body_corrupted",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "log",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, count(*) AS n, min(message) AS sample FROM abnormal_logs WHERE service_name='ts-preserve-service' AND message ILIKE '%Unrecognized token%hkg45r%' GROUP BY 1",
          "claim": "ts-preserve-service logged 1,511 SEVERE errors: response from security failed JSON parsing on token 'hkg45r'."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT c.service_name, c.span_name, c.attr_status_code, count(*) n, quantile_cont(c.duration,0.95)/1e6 p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces c JOIN abnormal_traces p ON c.parent_span_id = p.span_id AND c.trace_id = p.trace_id WHERE p.service_name='ts-preserve-service' GROUP BY 1,2,3 ORDER BY 4 DESC LIMIT 30",
          "claim": "Preserve's child span to security is Unset, yet preserve's controller span is Error on all 1,511 requests."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, count(*) n, sum(CASE WHEN attr_status_code='Error' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) errs, quantile_cont(duration,0.95)/1e6 p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-security-service' GROUP BY 1,2 ORDER BY 3 DESC LIMIT 10",
          "claim": "Security's own server spans show zero errors and normal latency, so the corruption is on the caller side of the call."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {
      "from": "ts-preserve-service",
      "to": "ts-ui-dashboard",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_status_code, count(*) n, quantile_cont(duration,0.95)/1e6 p95_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name IN ('ts-preserve-service','ts-ui-dashboard') AND span_name LIKE '%preserve%' GROUP BY 1,2,3 ORDER BY 1,4 DESC",
          "claim": "UI's POST /preserve spans error on 83 requests at p95 ~4.7s, matching preserve's failing 1,511 requests."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

